    "name": "Dashboard 2.0 thermostat — needs @flowfuse/node-red-dashboard",
    "info": "A thermostat page for one Gree unit, built on **Dashboard 2.0**: install `@flowfuse/node-red-dashboard` (Manage palette → Install) before importing.\n\n1. Edit the **Gree AC (dashboard)** config node: set **IP Address** to your AC's IP, or turn on *Resolve by MAC*.\n2. Deploy and open `http://<node-red>:1880/dashboard`.\n\nHow it works:\n\n- Every control sends `msg.topic` = property and `msg.payload` = value into **Gree HVAC** (the topic form of its input).\n- **Properties → widgets** feeds the controls, readouts and chart from the node's snapshot (output 2), sent after every change, and from a `getProperties` request every minute (answered on output 4).\n- The widgets don't pass input through, so a device update never echoes back as a command. The setpoint slider sends on release only.\n- **Diagnostics → status** shows the connection state and the firmware from output 3.\n- Readouts the unit has no sensor for show \"—\".",
